  <language>en_US</language>
  <keyword>fminsearch</keyword>
  <short_description>Unconstrained derivative-free minimization.</short_description>
  <syntax>
    <syntax_item>x = fminsearch(fun, x0)</syntax_item>
    <syntax_item>[x, fval, exitflag, output] = fminsearch(fun, x0, options)</syntax_item>
    <syntax_item>x = fminsearch(problem)</syntax_item>
  </syntax>
  <param_input>
    <param_input_item>
      <param_name>fun</param_name>
      <param_description>function handle or function name returning a scalar value.</param_description>
    </param_input_item>
    <param_input_item>
      <param_name>x0</param_name>
      <param_description>initial point.</param_description>
    </param_input_item>
    <param_input_item>
      <param_name>options</param_name>
      <param_description>structure or solver options created with optimset or optimoptions.</param_description>
    </param_input_item>
  </param_input>
  <param_output>
    <param_output_item>
      <param_name>x</param_name>
      <param_description>estimated minimizer.</param_description>
    </param_output_item>
    <param_output_item>
      <param_name>fval</param_name>
      <param_description>objective value at x.</param_description>
    </param_output_item>
    <param_output_item>
      <param_name>exitflag</param_name>
      <param_description>positive on convergence, zero on iteration or evaluation limit, negative when stopped by a callback.</param_description>
    </param_output_item>
    <param_output_item>
      <param_name>output</param_name>
      <param_description>diagnostic structure.</param_description>
    </param_output_item>
  </param_output>
  <description>
    <p>
      <b>fminsearch</b> uses the Nelder-Mead simplex method. Supported controls include TolX, TolFun, MaxIter, MaxFunEvals, Display, OutputFcn and PlotFcns. A problem structure can contain objective, x0 and options fields.</p>
  </description>
  <used_function>
    <used_function_item>optimset</used_function_item>
    <used_function_item>optimoptions</used_function_item>
  </used_function>
  <bibliography>J. A. Nelder and R. Mead, "A simplex method for function minimization", The Computer Journal, 1965.
J. C. Lagarias, J. A. Reeds, M. H. Wright and P. E. Wright, "Convergence properties of the Nelder-Mead simplex method in low dimensions", SIAM Journal on Optimization, 1998.</bibliography>
  <examples>
    <example_item>
      <example_item_type>nelson</example_item_type>
      <example_item_description />
      <example_item_data runnable="cli"><![CDATA[opts = optimset('TolX', 1e-8, 'TolFun', 1e-8);
[x, fval] = fminsearch(@(x) (x(1) - 1)^2 + (x(2) + 2)^2, [0 0], opts)
]]></example_item_data>
    </example_item>
  </examples>
